msgid "The database could not determine whether legacy tables exist. No legacy data was deleted. Check database permissions/connectivity and retry."
msgstr "Pangkalan data tidak dapat menentukan sama ada jadual lama wujud. Tiada data lama dipadam. Semak kebenaran/sambungan pangkalan data dan cuba semula."

#. translators: 1: legacy table name, 2: current table name.
#: includes/class-hatnch-plugin.php:172
#, php-format
msgid "Both legacy table \"%1$s\" and current table \"%2$s\" exist. Automatic merging is paused to avoid losing rows or breaking event-to-contact references. Back up both tables and reconcile them before retrying."
msgstr "Jadual lama \"%1$s\" dan jadual semasa \"%2$s\" kedua-duanya wujud. Penggabungan automatik dijeda untuk mengelakkan baris hilang atau rujukan peristiwa-ke-kenalan rosak. Sandarkan kedua-dua jadual dan selaraskannya sebelum mencuba semula."

#. translators: 1: legacy table name, 2: current table name.
#: includes/class-hatnch-plugin.php:200
#, php-format
msgid "Could not safely rename \"%1$s\" to \"%2$s\". The database version was not advanced and remaining legacy data was preserved. Correct the database error and retry."
msgstr "Tidak dapat menamakan semula \"%1$s\" kepada \"%2$s\" dengan selamat. Versi pangkalan data tidak dinaikkan dan baki data lama dikekalkan. Betulkan ralat pangkalan data dan cuba semula."

#. translators: 1: legacy option name, 2: current option name.
#: includes/class-hatnch-plugin.php:224
#, php-format
msgid "Could not verify the copied value from \"%1$s\" to \"%2$s\". The legacy option was preserved; resolve the conflict and retry."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengesahkan nilai yang disalin daripada \"%1$s\" kepada \"%2$s\". Pilihan lama dikekalkan; selesaikan percanggahan dan cuba semula."

#: includes/class-hatnch-plugin.php:468
msgid "Hatnikotni Chat could not verify its database tables after an upgrade. The database version was not advanced; check database errors and retry."
msgstr "Hatnikotni Chat tidak dapat mengesahkan jadual pangkalan datanya selepas naik taraf. Versi pangkalan data tidak dinaikkan; semak ralat pangkalan data dan cuba semula."

#: includes/class-hatnch-plugin.php:475
msgid "Hatnikotni Chat could not save its database version. The database version was not advanced; check database permissions and retry."
msgstr "Hatnikotni Chat tidak dapat menyimpan versi pangkalan datanya. Versi pangkalan data tidak dinaikkan; semak kebenaran pangkalan data dan cuba semula."

